        "mission_intent": "We need the collection management team to compile a comprehensive cross-committee oversight mapping that identifies every congressional committee\u2014both the Senate Select Committee on Intelligence, the House Permanent Select Committee on Intelligence, and all additional committees across both chambers\u2014that exercises oversight authority or funding responsibility over any element of the Intelligence Community, including those IC components embedded within broader departments and agencies. For each committee, the mapping should detail the specific nature of their oversight role, whether they hold authorization or appropriations authority, whether they receive covert action notifications, and the current party composition breakdown. This product needs to be delivered by close of business Thursday, but we also want it to reflect any committee reassignments or membership changes that may result from the upcoming session reorganization expected next month, so make sure those are incorporated as well. The final deliverable should be suitable for use as a reference annex to a tasking coordination memo going to the ODNI Civil Liberties Protection Officer's shop, so please ensure it addresses privacy and civil liberties coordination equities where relevant interagency matters intersect with legislative oversight functions. Best efforts to make this as complete and accurate as possible.",
